      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.45,
          "end": 5.45,
          "en": "So let's solve this challenge, this exercise together now.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.91,
          "end": 7.77,
          "en": "And for that here in the project,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.77,
          "end": 10.86,
          "en": "I'll start by adding these two new pages.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.86,
          "end": 13.38,
          "en": "And as you learned, you add a new page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.38,
          "end": 17.52,
          "en": "by adding a new folder to that app directory.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 17.52,
          "end": 20.82,
          "en": "Now here, since we want to have a slash news",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 20.82,
          "end": 24.97,
          "en": "path in the URL, the folder name should be news",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 25.89,
          "end": 28.59,
          "en": "because as you learned earlier in the course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 28.59,
          "end": 32.55,
          "en": "you add routes like this, such standard routes,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 32.55,
          "end": 36.54,
          "en": "which should lead to a certain path by adding a folder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 36.54,
          "end": 38.1,
          "en": "that in the end concludes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 38.1,
          "end": 42.39,
          "en": "that route path name in the app folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 42.39,
          "end": 45.72,
          "en": "So if you wanna navigate to a slash about page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 45.72,
          "end": 49.56,
          "en": "you would add an about folder in the app folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 49.56,
          "end": 51,
          "en": "Therefore, that's what I did here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 51,
          "end": 54.33,
          "en": "Though, as you also learned, that's not enough.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 54.33,
          "end": 58.8,
          "en": "Instead, you also must add a file named page.js",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 58.8,
          "end": 61.08,
          "en": "in that news folder,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 61.08,
          "end": 65.22,
          "en": "and it could also end with jsx if you prefer that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 65.22,
          "end": 69.513,
          "en": "or if you're using TypeScript with .ts or tsx.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 70.35,
          "end": 72.81,
          "en": "Now here I'll go for .Js.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 72.81,
          "end": 76.2,
          "en": "So that is the first page, though of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 76.2,
          "end": 78.393,
          "en": "at the moment I'm not displaying anything.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 79.38,
          "end": 82.38,
          "en": "Now before I'll worry about outputting something,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 82.38,
          "end": 84.53999999999999,
          "en": "I want to add that second page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 84.53999999999999,
          "end": 88.17,
          "en": "and that should be a nested page slash news",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 88.17,
          "end": 89.94,
          "en": "slash something else.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 89.94,
          "end": 94.14,
          "en": "And that something else should be dynamic.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 94.14,
          "end": 98.34,
          "en": "It should be a value that can be different",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 98.34,
          "end": 101.28,
          "en": "for every navigation request.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 101.28,
          "end": 104.94,
          "en": "And you learned that such dynamic routes can be added",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 104.94,
          "end": 107.7,
          "en": "by defining a folder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 107.7,
          "end": 112.08,
          "en": "that wraps the placeholder for the actual value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 112.08,
          "end": 117.08,
          "en": "that will be encoded in the URL between square brackets.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 117.66,
          "end": 122.25,
          "en": "Therefore here I'll add a sub folder in the news folder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 122.25,
          "end": 125.16,
          "en": "and add those square brackets.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 125.16,
          "end": 130.16,
          "en": "And then here I will use ID as a placeholder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 130.5,
          "end": 133.26,
          "en": "And the exact placeholder here is up to you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 133.26,
          "end": 135.723,
          "en": "You can use any identifier of your choice.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 136.71,
          "end": 139.86,
          "en": "And then in there I also add a page.js file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 139.86,
          "end": 142.773,
          "en": "so that we now added these two pages.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 144.06,
          "end": 145.86,
          "en": "Now in order to output something there,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 145.86,
          "end": 150.69,
          "en": "we then must export function components in those",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 150.69,
          "end": 152.55,
          "en": "page js files.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 152.55,
          "end": 155.04,
          "en": "So here I have the news page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 155.04,
          "end": 157.77,
          "en": "and I'll simply return a age one element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 157.77,
          "end": 160.233,
          "en": "where I say news page for now.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 161.52,
          "end": 165.3,
          "en": "And then here in the nested news detail page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 165.3,
          "end": 168.39,
          "en": "I'll name it news detail page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 168.39,
          "end": 172.38,
          "en": "and have news detail page in my title here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 172.38,
          "end": 175.92000000000002,
          "en": "And if we now save both files",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 175.92000000000002,
          "end": 179.16,
          "en": "and we go back to the application, we can navigate to",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 179.16,
          "end": 184.16,
          "en": "slash news and we see that news page text here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 185.34,
          "end": 189.78,
          "en": "and we can also go to slash news slash abc",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 189.78,
          "end": 192.15,
          "en": "and we're on the news detail page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 192.15,
          "end": 194.253,
          "en": "so that works the way it should.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 195.33,
          "end": 198.32999999999998,
          "en": "Now of course, this wasn't everything though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 198.32999999999998,
          "end": 200.97,
          "en": "Instead the goal was to output a list",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 200.97,
          "end": 203.94,
          "en": "of links on the news page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 203.94,
          "end": 207.003,
          "en": "Links that lead us to the news detail page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 208.2,
          "end": 212.63400000000001,
          "en": "Therefore, in that news page here, I will actually",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 212.63400000000001,
          "end": 215.23,
          "en": "wrap a fragment around my content",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 216.48,
          "end": 220.38,
          "en": "and then here output a list of links.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 220.38,
          "end": 223.71,
          "en": "And for that I'll use an on or a list with list items.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 223.71,
          "end": 227.97,
          "en": "And those links should lead to the detail page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 227.97,
          "end": 229.92000000000002,
          "en": "Now, we could add those links",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 229.92000000000002,
          "end": 233.37,
          "en": "by using the standard anchor element, right?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 233.37,
          "end": 235.8,
          "en": "We could add a link that leads",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 235.8,
          "end": 240.8,
          "en": "to slash news slash ABC like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 241.2,
          "end": 245.01,
          "en": "However, as you learned in the essentials section,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 245.01,
          "end": 247.38,
          "en": "this is not the recommended way",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 247.38,
          "end": 251.46,
          "en": "of creating internal links in your website",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 251.46,
          "end": 253.383,
          "en": "when using NextJS.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 254.25,
          "end": 256.71,
          "en": "Instead, you should replace the anchor element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 256.71,
          "end": 261.48,
          "en": "with the link component, which is provided by NextJS,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 261.48,
          "end": 265.203,
          "en": "and you import that from next link.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 266.4,
          "end": 267.48,
          "en": "And you should use that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 267.48,
          "end": 269.04,
          "en": "because this will then ensure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 269.04,
          "end": 272.76,
          "en": "that you stay in this single page application",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 272.76,
          "end": 274.233,
          "en": "flow and world.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 275.49,
          "end": 278.15999999999997,
          "en": "So here I'll simply add three links.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 278.15999999999997,
          "end": 281.04,
          "en": "Let's say it's up to you how many you want.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 281.04,
          "end": 285.09000000000003,
          "en": "And I'll name the first one first news",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 285.09000000000003,
          "end": 290.09000000000003,
          "en": "and first dash news could be my ID of that news item.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 290.15999999999997,
          "end": 293.19,
          "en": "And maybe let's say first news item here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 293.19,
          "end": 297.54,
          "en": "Then I have the second news item here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 297.54,
          "end": 301.08,
          "en": "And the ID is second dash news.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 301.08,
          "end": 303.66,
          "en": "And then here the ID is third dash news.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 303.66,
          "end": 306.33,
          "en": "And as you might guess, I'll have a text",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 306.33,
          "end": 308.823,
          "en": "of third news item.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 310.86,
          "end": 315.24,
          "en": "So now we have these three links, and if we now save that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 315.24,
          "end": 319.14,
          "en": "and we go back to the news page, we see them here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 319.14,
          "end": 322.8,
          "en": "Obviously not styled yet, we'll take care of that later.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 322.8,
          "end": 325.95,
          "en": "But we see these items.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 325.95,
          "end": 327.75,
          "en": "And if I click the second news item,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 327.75,
          "end": 329.73,
          "en": "you see that in the URL",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 329.73,
          "end": 333.57,
          "en": "I have that second dash news ID now,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 333.57,
          "end": 335.613,
          "en": "and we're on the news detail page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 337.59000000000003,
          "end": 341.49,
          "en": "Now as a bonus task, I asked you to extract",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 341.49,
          "end": 344.1,
          "en": "that value of that id",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 344.1,
          "end": 346.32,
          "en": "that is encoded in the URL.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 346.32,
          "end": 351.32,
          "en": "So second dash news for this news item, for example.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 351.63,
          "end": 353.4,
          "en": "And this can be achieved by going to",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 353.4,
          "end": 355.53,
          "en": "that news detail page component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 355.53,
          "end": 359.25,
          "en": "And then there you can extract some props",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 359.25,
          "end": 361.2,
          "en": "which are passed into this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 361.2,
          "end": 363.933,
          "en": "component automatically by NextJS.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 364.92,
          "end": 369.92,
          "en": "To be precise, NextJS will pass a params prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 370.23,
          "end": 373.17,
          "en": "into every page component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 373.17,
          "end": 376.26,
          "en": "So whenever you register something as a page component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 376.26,
          "end": 380.46,
          "en": "by making it the default export in a page JS file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 380.46,
          "end": 382.503,
          "en": "it will receive this params prop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 383.55,
          "end": 388.17,
          "en": "And this params prop here will be an object which holds",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 388.17,
          "end": 391.86,
          "en": "one key for every dynamic path segment.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 391.86,
          "end": 395.97,
          "en": "So here we have that ID dynamic path segment,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 395.97,
          "end": 399.1,
          "en": "and therefore this params object will have an ID key",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 400.35,
          "end": 402.663,
          "en": "and that will then be our news id.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 403.56,
          "end": 407.76,
          "en": "And therefore, now here I'll actually also output some",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 407.76,
          "end": 409.44,
          "en": "content that's wrapped by a fragment",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 409.44,
          "end": 414.3,
          "en": "because I also want to have a paragraph where I say news ID",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 414.3,
          "end": 416.97,
          "en": "and where I output that news ID.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 416.97,
          "end": 417.803,
          "en": "Like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 419.82,
          "end": 422.82,
          "en": "With that saved, if you reload and go back,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 422.82,
          "end": 424.35,
          "en": "you see that now we have",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 424.35,
          "end": 427.26,
          "en": "that second news Id being output here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 427.26,
          "end": 429.66,
          "en": "and hopefully, unsurprisingly,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 429.66,
          "end": 432.12,
          "en": "if I would visit the third news item,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 432.12,
          "end": 434.823,
          "en": "we would see third news here.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
